eria\n\n- A release note exists covering the shipped Kueue scheduling visibility features, measured\n  by the release note draft being complete and technically reviewed against the\n  implemented behavior.\n- The feature-level documentation determination is recorded with rationale, measured by a\n  written decision (doc topics delivered, or release-note-suffices with justification)\n  attached to this epic.\n- All documented statements are accurate against the implementation, measured by technical\n  review sign-off comparing the doc content to the shipped behavior (indicators conditional\n  on Kueue-managed namespaces; queue position shown only with Visibility API RBAC;\n  unrecognized statuses showing the raw Kueue condition message).\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-5 (P0, documentation of): workload scheduling status display with message overrides\n  and raw-message fallback.\n- HLR-3 (P0, documentation of): positive Kueue indicator on project details page.\n- HLR-4 (P0, documentation of): anomaly indicator on non-Kueue workloads.\n- HLR-6 (P1, documentation of): queue position display via the Visibility API and its\n  RBAC-dependent availability.\n- HLR-7 (P1, documentation of): HardwareProfile popover source indication for\n  GitOps-applied queue labels.\n- HLR-8 (P1, documentation of): LocalQueue name validation and the non-blocking\n  missing-queue warning.\n- HLR-9 (P1, documentation of): HP dropdown explanation in Kueue-managed namespaces.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45572,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a60dde69fe10feb4","agent_id":"a4bc18f31254a1faa","session_id":"c707f99e-2a7a-41d1-b409-ac9a210055ae","uuid":"f4201d1b-998e-42ce-9e37-db3d534c40ed","timestamp":"2026-10-22T04:52:56.849Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8002 into epics"}
