ver source indication for\n83\t  GitOps-applied queue labels.\n84\t- HLR-8 (P1, documentation of): LocalQueue name validation and the non-blocking\n85\t  missing-queue warning.\n86\t- HLR-9 (P1, documentation of): HP dropdown explanation in Kueue-managed namespaces.\n87\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9a0f5f8d63ce7094","agent_id":"a27a0f8da6f907826","session_id":"c707f99e-2a7a-41d1-b409-ac9a210055ae","uuid":"e2a2392d-6bef-42ef-8282-3dd20a1a1c7c","timestamp":"2026-10-22T05:00:37.390Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-87f60816b48467e6","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-8002 decomposition"}
